          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 3.925,
          "text": "CCECC FUZHOU SURVEY & DESIGN INSTITUTE\nCO. Domestic Project Business Management Measures"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 3,
          "candidate_block": 2,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 3.959,
          "text": "Chapter 1 General Provisions"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 4,
          "candidate_block": 3,
          "candidate_line_count": 6,
          "center_error": 13.188,
          "text": "Article 1 In accordance with the guiding opinions of the joint­stock company on high­quality\nbusiness work, and in combination with the relevant requirements of the Group Company's\nImplementation Rules for High­Quality Business Work (Trial) (Zhongtu Jingying [2024] No.\n341), this Measure is specially formulated to comprehensively improve the quality of\nproject business, effectively manage the company's domestic business work, and\nstandardize business procedures and workflows."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 8,
          "candidate_block": 4,
          "candidate_line_count": 8,
          "center_error": 15.351,
          "text": "Article 2 Projects in these Measures refer to various types of the Company's\nbusiness undertakings such as consulting, survey, design, supervision, and\nengineering general contracting undertaken through direct entrustment or\nbidding.\nArticle 3 In principle, business undertaking work shall follow the procedure of first project assessment, then\napplication for approval, and finally contract signing. Article 4 When carrying out project business undertaking\nwork, factors such as the Company's development strategy, business direction, responsibility cost, production\nand technical capabilities, and current status"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 5,
          "center_error": 13.809,
          "text": "Article 4 shall be comprehensively considered. In accordance with the process\nprovisions of these Measures, the work of links such as \"information tracking,\nproject assessment and application, bid document preparation and review,\ncontract negotiation, contract review and signing, owner services during project\nimplementation, and project return visits\" shall be completed."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 12,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 12.008,
          "text": "Chapter 2 Relevant Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 17,
          "candidate_block": 8,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 9.546,
          "text": "Article 6 The relevant personnel involved in project business work and their\nmain responsibilities are shown in Table 1 below:"
        },
        {
