          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 18,
          "candidate_block": 0,
          "candidate_line_count": 4,
          "center_error": 16.098,
          "text": "Article 5 The Business Development Department is the management department\nfor the Company's domestic project business work and is responsible for the\nlayout and development of the institute's business market. - 2 -"
